          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is the NordicTrack C 990 good for running, or just walking?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              It's built primarily for walking and light jogging. The 3.0
              CHP motor and 20 x 55-inch deck are smaller than
              NordicTrack's Commercial-series machines, and taller or
