          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How does the C 990 compare to the C 1650?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              They share the same 3.0 CHP motor and 0-10% incline range, but
              the C 1650 has a longer 20 x 60-inch deck versus the C 990's
              20 x 55-inch deck, plus a larger 10-inch touchscreen instead
              of 7 inches. If your budget allows the roughly $300 jump, the
              C 1650's extra deck length is genuinely noticeable for anyone
              who runs rather than only walks.
            </p>
