              machines at comparable speeds, which tracks with its smaller
              3.0 CHP motor working somewhat harder relative to its size
              during faster jogging. It's not intrusive during normal
              walking or light jogging, but sustained running above 6 mph
              produces noticeably more motor noise than the pricier models
              in NordicTrack's lineup.
